---
layout: layouts/page
title: Notre Carte
subtitle: "Nos créations sucrées et saveurs du monde — pâtisseries, curries, box repas et formules événements."
description: "La carte complète Nimara : pâtisseries artisanales, cuisine indienne authentique, box repas midi et formules traiteur à Genève."
eyebrow: "Douceurs · Saveurs du Monde · Box Midi · Formules"
permalink: /carte/
---

<section class="section" id="carte-section">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Controls -->
    <div class="menu-controls">
      <div class="filter-tabs">
        <button class="filter-tab is-active" data-filter="all">Tout voir</button>
        {% for cat in menu.categories %}
        <button class="filter-tab" data-filter="{{ cat.id }}">{{ cat.icon }} {{ cat.label.fr }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Langue">
        <button class="lang-btn is-active" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
        <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en">EN</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Menu sections by category -->
    {% for cat in menu.categories %}
    <div class="menu-section" data-category="{{ cat.id }}" id="{{ cat.id }}">
      <h2 class="menu-section-title">
        <span>{{ cat.icon }}</span>
        <span data-lang-fr="{{ cat.label.fr }}" data-lang-en="{{ cat.label.en }}">{{ cat.label.fr }}</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="menu-grid">
        {% for product in menu.products %}
        {% if product.category == cat.id %}
        <article class="menu-card" data-category="{{ product.category }}">
          {% if product.badge %}
          <span class="menu-badge {{ product.badge | lower | replace(' ', '-') | replace('é', 'e') | replace('è', 'e') }}">{{ product.badge }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="menu-card__header">
            <h3 class="menu-card__name"
                data-lang-fr="{{ product.name.fr }}"
                data-lang-en="{{ product.name.en }}">{{ product.name.fr }}</h3>
            <span class="menu-card__price">
              {% if product.price %}
                CHF {{ product.price | chf | replace("CHF ", "") }}
              {% else %}
                {{ product.priceLabel.fr }}
              {% endif %}
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card__desc"
             data-lang-fr="{{ product.description.fr }}"
             data-lang-en="{{ product.description.en }}">{{ product.description.fr }}</p>
          <div class="menu-card__footer">
            <div class="menu-card__allergens">
              {% for a in product.allergens %}
              <span class="allergen-pill" title="{{ menu.allergenKeys[a].fr }}">{{ menu.allergenKeys[a].fr }}</span>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% if product.weight %}
            <span style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--gray-500)">{{ product.weight }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <!-- Allergen legend -->
    <div style="margin-top:3rem;padding:1.5rem;background:var(--gray-100);border-radius:12px">
      <h4 style="margin-bottom:.75rem;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gray-500)">Allergènes</h4>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem">
        {% for key, labels in menu.allergenKeys %}
        <span class="allergen-pill">{{ labels.fr }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gray-500);margin-top:.75rem;max-width:none">
        Notre atelier manipule gluten, lactose, fruits à coque, œufs, sésame et autres allergènes. En cas d'allergie sévère, contactez-nous avant de commander.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Une question ? Une commande ?</h2>
    <p>Envoyez-nous un message WhatsApp, nous répondons sous 15 minutes.</p>
    <div class="btn-actions">
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}"
         class="btn btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Commander sur WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
